       }
      ],
      "text": "Interactions (all diuretics):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " lithium—⍉, diuretics cut its clearance and risk toxicity; NSAIDs can blunt the diuretic and antiHTN effect of loop, K-sparing and thiazide diuretics."
     }
